Package: xios-desktop-defaults
Name: Xios desktop defaults
Version: 1.1.13
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Depends: x11-fonts-sf, fontconfig, dbus, libglib2.0-bin, hicolor-icon-theme
Section: X11
Priority: optional
Description: Retina, XDG, GTK, font and session defaults for Xios
 Installs the ambient distro defaults that make X11/GTK/Xfce/GNOME apps feel
 at home on rootless iOS: rootless PATH and XDG directories, UTF-8 locale,
 native iPad retina display profile, Xft antialiasing/DPI resources, GTK3/GTK4
 defaults, touch-friendly cursor sizing, and cache/schema/database setup hooks
 (the hicolor icon-theme index is owned by hicolor-icon-theme). Uses Apple's .SF UI Mono as the
 system monospace through fontconfig and a gschema override, so terminals
 (VTE/Console) follow the native San Francisco stack. The profile is sourced
 by launchers when present.
 .
 APT pins keep the ICU 74 family and Xios repo packages preferred over
 Procursus downgrade candidates.
